<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Edelman Letter - Jeffrey M. Surrell to Dave Ahearn</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 60px;
    color: #000;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    position: relative;
  }

  .header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .header-left {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .header-left .company-name {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .header-right {
    text-align: right;
  }

  .header-right .pr-tag {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .header-right .brand {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
    font-size: 44px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .brand .big {
    font-size: 54px;
  }

  .date-block {
    margin: 30px 0 30px 0;
  }

  .address-block {
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .address-block div {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .salutation {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 18px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }

  ul.bullets {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 18px 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  ul.bullets li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 45px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  ul.bullets li::before {
    content: "\25A0";
    position: absolute;
    left: 15px;
    top: 2px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .closing {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .signature-img {
    height: 70px;
    margin: 10px 0 5px 0;
    font-family: 'Brush Script MT', cursive;
    font-size: 40px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #111;
  }

  .stamp {
    position: absolute;
    top: 620px;
    left: 480px;
    width: 150px;
    height: 130px;
    border: 1px dashed #999;
    transform: rotate(-8deg);
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 9px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #555;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(240,240,240,0.4);
  }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 40px;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #111;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .footer-icon {
    text-align: right;
    margin-top: -10px;
    margin-right: 0px;
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .placeholder {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px dashed #999;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-left">
      <div class="company-name">DANIEL J. EDELMAN, INC.</div>
      <div>
        1420 K Street, N.W.<br>
        10th Floor<br>
        Washington, D.C. 20005<br>
        Phone 202. 371-0200<br>
        FAX 202. 371-0490<br>
        FAX 202. 371-2858<br>
        Telex 6501454152 MCI
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
      <div class="pr-tag">Public Relations Worldwide</div>
      <div class="brand"><span class="big">E</span>DELMAN</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="date-block">April 6, 1995</div>

  <div class="address-block">
    <div>Mr. Dave Ahearn</div>
    <div>Economic Correspondent</div>
    <div>Bloomberg Business News</div>
    <div>292 National Press Building</div>
    <div>Washington, DC&nbsp;&nbsp;20045</div>
  </div>

  <div class="salutation">Dear Mr. Ahearn:</div>

  <p>As you know, negotiations are getting underway for Chile to join the North American Free Trade Agreement.  President Clinton and the other Nafta nations made the invitation last December.</p>

  <p>Edelman is handling Chile&rsquo;s communications activities in the United States, and I want to let you know that we can be of assistance when you prepare stories on the upcoming negotiations.  We can provide you with a broad range of information on Chile such as media kits and interview opportunities with Chilean officials.</p>

  <p style="position: relative; margin-bottom: 0;">It is important to keep in mind why the Nafta nations selected Chile as their first Latin American
  partner:</p>

  <div style="position: relative;">
    <ul class="bullets">
      <li>Chile&rsquo;s economy has undergone dramatic reform and is one of the most open and advanced in Latin America;</li>
      <li>Chile can serve as a key building block in expanding economic reforms and more open trade throughout the hemisphere;</li>
      <li>Chile is a proven investment partner for the U.S.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="stamp">
      [Stamp: illegible, rotated &mdash; "RECEIVED DEPT. OF JUSTICE CRIMIN. DIVISION JUN 29 [?] [illegible]"]
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>Please feel free to contact me if I can be of any assistance.  My phone number is 202-371-0200.</p>

  <div class="closing">
    <div>Sincerely,</div>
    <div class="signature-img">Jeff Surrell</div>
    <div>Jeffrey M. Surrell</div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div>Atlanta&nbsp; Chicago&nbsp; Dallas&nbsp; Houston&nbsp; Los Angeles&nbsp; Louisville&nbsp; New York&nbsp; Sacramento&nbsp; San Francisco&nbsp; Silicon Valley&nbsp; Washington</div>
    <div>Argentina&nbsp; Beijing&nbsp; Brussels&nbsp; Dublin&nbsp; Frankfurt&nbsp; Guangzhou&nbsp; Hong Kong&nbsp; Kuala Lumpur&nbsp; London&nbsp; Madrid&nbsp; Melbourne</div>
    <div>Mexico City&nbsp; Milan&nbsp; Montreal&nbsp; Paris&nbsp; Shanghai&nbsp; Singapore&nbsp; Sydney&nbsp; Tokyo&nbsp; Toronto</div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-icon">&#10052;</div>

</body>
</html>
```
